## Open design decisions

1. Whether normal operation should enforce zero transcript reads or allow a
   bounded completion tail.
2. Whether to include a deterministic state-change watcher in the skill.
3. Where workers should publish the compact completion/block handoff.
4. Whether routine completions should be reported immediately or summarized at
   the end of the wave.
